{
  "hours_per_week": 10,
  "intro": "Eight core weeks at about 10 hours, then four optional weeks. Meta is the primary loop. Amazon is second, including leadership principles. Mocks start in week 5. System design at scale is the L5 stretch. Banks are a safety appendix.",
